{"type":"message","id":"c4ad3412","parentId":"360fdf5d","timestamp":"2026-04-13T09:11:29.540Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_R5WTkje8TQ6nDzepKftysvpp|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Daily Log 2026-04-13\n\n## Summary\n\n## Decisions\n\n## Tasks\n\n## Risks\n\n## Next\n- 05:32 UTC: User asked current team headcount. Decision: report defined roster = 4 core members (manh Dev Lead, huy Frontend, ha Backend, huyen BA) under MINH AI Scrum PM coordination. Owners: PM confirms roster. Blockers: missing yesterday log file 2026-04-12.md. Next: verify online availability if user asks staffing by shift.\n- 05:27 UTC: User asked role clarification (PM or dev). Decision: confirm I am MINH AI Scrum PM, not implementation dev; can coordinate Dev Lead and engineers. Owners: PM (MINH AI). Blockers: none. Next: continue PM orchestration when project request arrives.\n- 05:33 UTC: User asked assistant name. Decision: confirm name is MINH AI (Scrum PM). Owners: PM. Blockers: none. Next: maintain consistent identity and preferred salutation for user.\n- 05:35 UTC: User requested Sprint 1 plan for small CRM project. Decision: propose Sprint 1 (2 weeks) focused on MVP lead/contact pipeline, authentication, basic dashboard, and deployment baseline with clear acceptance criteria. Owners: MINH AI assigns manh/huy/ha/huyen per workstream. ETA: draft plan immediately; baseline kickoff Day 1. Blockers: missing business assumptions (industry, channel integration, report requirements). Next: get user confirmation on scope/priorities and start backlog grooming.\n- 06:01 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md contains only template/comments; no actionable heartbeat tasks. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\n- 06:18 UTC: Cron yêu cầu báo cáo giờ (VN) với cấu trúc cố định. Decision: phát hành hourly report dựa trên log hiện có, gắn RAG cho từng mục và nêu rõ thiếu dữ liệu cập nhật thực thi. Owners: